      "versionNonce": 260155448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791955717191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. String and StringBuffer are availbale from JDK 1.0  .\n\n2. StringBuilder was added from JDK 5.\n\n3. All Belongs to java.lang package .\n\n***  String is IMMUTABLE while StringBuffer is MUTTABLE .\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. String and StringBuffer are availbale from JDK 1.0  .\n\n2. StringBuilder was added from JDK 5.\n\n3. All Belongs to java.lang package .\n\n***  String is IMMUTABLE while StringBuffer is MUTTABLE .\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
