      "locked": false,
      "text": "String Object\n\n\n1. Lives in\nheap area\n\n2. New Object\nis always\ncreated when\ncontent is\nsame . \n\n3. Created at\nrun time .\n\n4. cleaned by\nGC .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "String Object\n\n\n1. Lives in heap area\n\n2. New Object is always created when content is same . \n\n3. Created at run time .\n\n4. cleaned by GC .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
