      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "String Literal \n\n\n1. lives inside special memory of Heap\ncalled as String constant pool\n\n2. Same object is used if content is\nsame .\n\n\n\n\n3. Created at compile time .\n\n\n4. No GC is allowed to enter SCP .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "String Literal \n\n\n1. lives inside special memory of Heap called as String constant pool\n\n2. Same object is used if content is same .\n\n\n\n\n3. Created at compile time .\n\n\n4. No GC is allowed to enter SCP .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
